-- NORM-LOG N10 goal A: a compound armed inside a continuation joins the lockstep (it is flattened into the
-- outermost driver). Pass: FULFILLED, and the official record in time order: b (2), d (3), c (4).
-- Before A it was b, c, d: the left operand, with the compound its HENCE arms, ran over the whole trace first.
IMPORT prelude
DECLARE Who IS ONE OF P, Q, R, S
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF a, b, c, d

GIVETH DEONTIC Who Act
inner MEANS
       (PARTY Q MUST b WITHIN 10 HENCE COMMIT `seen` IS "b" HENCE FULFILLED)
  RAND (PARTY R MUST c WITHIN 10 HENCE COMMIT `seen` IS "c" HENCE FULFILLED)

GIVETH DEONTIC Who Act
outer MEANS
       (PARTY P MUST a WITHIN 5 HENCE inner)
  RAND (PARTY S MUST d WITHIN 20 HENCE COMMIT `seen` IS "d" HENCE FULFILLED)

#TRACE outer AT 0 WITH PARTY P DOES a AT 1  PARTY Q DOES b AT 2  PARTY S DOES d AT 3  PARTY R DOES c AT 4
